{"id":"d9a8e20998fad98e","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-stone-space.md","title":"Stone Space","display":"df-stone-space — Stone Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-stone-space","aliases":["93-df-stone-space"],"display":"df-stone-space — Stone Space","depends_on":["[[93-df-profinite]]","[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-stone-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-stone-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stone-space — Stone Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f5dec406c92aa2e\" href=\"?note=2f5dec406c92aa2e\" title=\"93-df-profinite\">93-df-profinite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Haus}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Haus}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\\)</span> are the topology and Hausdorff predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2f5dec406c92aa2e\" href=\"?note=2f5dec406c92aa2e\" title=\"93-df-profinite\">93-df-profinite</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\)</span> is the finite-set predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Clopen}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Clopen}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactSpace}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactSpace}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroDim}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroDim}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Clopen}_{93}(U;A,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\\land U\\subseteq A\n\\land U\\in\\mathcal T\\land A\\setminus U\\in\\mathcal T\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Clopen}_{93}(U;A,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\\land U\\subseteq A\n\\land U\\in\\mathcal T\\land A\\setminus U\\in\\mathcal T\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompactSpace}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal T\\;\\Bigl(\nA\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal U_0\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;(\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(\\mathcal U_0)\\land A\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U_0)\n\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZeroDim}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\\land\n\\forall U\\in\\mathcal T\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\n\\exists C\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Clopen}_{93}(C;A,\\mathcal T)\n\\land x\\in C\\subseteq U\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CompactSpace}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Haus}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroDim}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CompactSpace}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal T\\;\\Bigl(\nA\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal U_0\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;(\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(\\mathcal U_0)\\land A\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U_0)\n\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ZeroDim}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\\land\n\\forall U\\in\\mathcal T\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\n\\exists C\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Clopen}_{93}(C;A,\\mathcal T)\n\\land x\\in C\\subseteq U\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CompactSpace}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Haus}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroDim}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Compactness here is a topological open-cover property and is deliberately named differently from finitarity of a consequence relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-profinite","status":"resolved","id":"2f5dec406c92aa2e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-profinite]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-profinite","status":"resolved","id":"2f5dec406c92